    "body": "## Summary\n- add PostGIS-backed job coordinates using `geography(Point,4326)` and a GiST index\n- require validated coordinates when creating new jobs\n- expose public nearby search ordered by distance\n- separate `publicLabel` from optional `privateLabel` so discovery never leaks exact address text\n- restrict exact coordinates/private label to the requester or assigned worker during an active job\n- add request-parameter error handling and security rules for nearby search\n- document PostGIS, matching and privacy invariants\n- run PostGIS, location privacy, escrow and gateway checks in CI\n\n## Safety and privacy invariants\n- public job responses never contain latitude or longitude\n- public job responses contain only `publicLabel`\n- `privateLabel` never appears in create/list/nearby public DTOs\n- `/jobs/{id}/location` remains authenticated\n- assigned workers can access exact location only while the job is active\n- unrelated users cannot access exact location\n- location search is bounded by radius and result-limit validation\n\n## Database\n- enable PostGIS with Flyway V3\n- add `jobs.location` as `GEOGRAPHY(POINT,4326)`\n- add public/private location-label columns\n- add GiST spatial index and open-job supporting index\n- use PostGIS distance operations directly in PostgreSQL\n\n## Verification\n- Maven unit tests\n- production dependency audit, lint and frontend build\n- Docker runtime smoke with PostgreSQL/PostGIS, auth, wallet escrow, nearby search, coordinate privacy, private-label privacy and Nginx gateway\n\nSee `docs/LOCATION_AND_MATCHING.md` for the architectural contract.",
